  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Garanti Nova Banka subentionen &#xe4;r ber&#xe4;knad enligt f&#xf6;ljande:            Indikerad garantiavgift 3,4% per &#xe5;r.                                  uppl&#xe4;ggningsavfigt p&#xe5; 0,75%                                           Garantiperiod 10 &#xe5;r, succesivt utnyttjande under 6 &#xe5;r och sedan      succesivt &#xe5;terbetalt.                                                  Nova Bankas genomsnittliga l&#xf6;ptid p&#xe5; underliggande l&#xe5;n 3 &#xe5;r.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Guarantee Nova Banka subsidy calculation is based as follows:          Indicated guarantee fee from EKN 3.4% p.a.                            Origination fee of 0,75%                                              Guarantee period 10 years, which is utilized successively over 6     years and then repaid successively                                     Nova banka average tenor in underlying loans of 3 years</narrative>
  </description>
